    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d337-a1">

                <pb facs="0528" n="456" xml:id="pg456"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 20.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Houghton to Mr. Frelinghuysen</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Maritime Association of the Port of New York</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1881-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 16, 1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith the
                    memorial of this association upon the subject of the illegal tax of 10 cents per
                    ton upon cargoes for Cuba and Porto Rico levied by the Spanish consulate, and
                    trust that it may have your early attention.</p>
                <p>Yours, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>F. W. HOUGHTON,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
